Upstream attribution
--------------------
The mathematical content in papers/ is derived from the preprints in the public
openai/math repository (https://github.com/openai/math), which is distributed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. All mathematical claims, statements and
proofs belong to their original authors; each paper keeps its original title,
source slug and date. This project is not affiliated with and is not endorsed
by OpenAI.

Statement of changes
--------------------
The papers were modified. Changes include: English editorial distillation, repair
of extracted citations and references, restoration of label anchors, textual
figure descriptions and inline diagram source where applicable, reading maps,
engineering contracts and limitations, structured metadata blocks, graph links
and catalogues (catalogue/, Catalogo_Math.md).

The following were added and are original to this repository: the router
(tools/route_v2.py and the index builder, evaluation and gate tools), its
vocabulary, thesaurus and parameters (standards/, out/params.json), the built
index (out/index), the evaluation benchmark (eval/, test_eval/) and the measured
results. Generated interpretation is identified separately from the original
text; this notice makes no independent correctness claim.
